  "details": "With the ability to use other parameters besides floats, we should have the UI reflect the ability to choose these options. \nFor example, we are able to choose our receiver type, then our parameter type, then the information displayed below for the parameter changes accordingly.\nThis would allow people to be less confused about which parameter type they're working with and it also restores the functionality to drive floats to other values besides 0 and 1 with Contact and OnEnter receivers.",
